OL,3,GNEWSA'Criminal' flag-raising causing
OL,4,Aalarm and distress, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of an anti-migrant group have
OL,7,Ferected flags in Birmingham in a
OL,8,F"criminal" way that causes "danger,
OL,9,Finjury, alarm and distress", a court
OL,10,Fhas been told.
OL,12,FThe city council is seeking an
OL,13,Femergency injunction against members of
OL,14,FRaise the Colours, who have flown
OL,15,Fthousands of union jacks and St
OL,16,FGeorge's flags from lamp-posts and
OL,17,Fbridges in the city.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
