OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'Criminal' flag-raising causing
OL,4,Aalarm and distress, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FJonathan Manning, representing the
OL,7,Fauthority at the city's High Court
OL,8,Fhearing, said people had reported
OL,9,Ffeeling "significantly less safe"
OL,10,Ffollowing a series of violent and
OL,11,Fthreatening incidents, including one
OL,12,Fman who suffered a broken leg when hit
OL,13,Fby a cherry picker.
OL,15,FRyan Bridge, founder of Raise the
OL,16,FColours, said in a statement he would
OL,17,Ffight the action, adding it was against
OL,18,Fthe European Convention on Human
OL,19,FRights.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
